{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">處境劇《愛·回家之三代同糖》飾演「唐芯」的李茵彤與「盧漢娜」的胡敏芝（Karen）是大學同學兼最好閨密，兩人經常「孖公仔」周圍去，深受年輕觀眾喜愛。原來這對好姊妹不單止在螢幕前默契十足，戲外同樣感情極好。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"69910361-1b38-4e4b-af4b-198bb32e297d.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026h5VAkVVrnK1788338225.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"69910361-1b38-4e4b-af4b-198bb32e297d.png.webp\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">日前，胡敏芝在社交網分享了多段與李茵彤的超歡樂拍攝花絮，其中一條短片可見，李茵彤正努力對鏡補妝，似乎在為接下來的「返學戲」做足準備，極度貪靚可愛。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">Karen 亦晒出她們鏡頭背後齊齊返工、放工的貼地日常。無論是等埋位還是收工，兩人依然形影不離，足見她們私底下已經建立起深厚的友誼。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"84fedb5a-619e-4eda-8cb7-55b2244bb391.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026MYDj8kZKrV1788338224.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"84fedb5a-619e-4eda-8cb7-55b2244bb391.png.webp\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">除了大晒閨密情，胡敏芝更畀驚喜大家，罕有晒出一張 8 年前的真實學生照。相中的 Karen 穿著校服，展現出無敵青春氣息。最令人驚訝的是，對比現時的靚樣，她的五官與輪廓竟然「零走樣」，完全沒有太大變化。</p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"karenwumc_1788262530_3976556637263035820_249010228.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026L4S3cpzMpN1788338525.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"karenwumc_1788262530_3976556637263035820_249010228.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-02T09:04:11.470929+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":345,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}